B.a8R=s(["Meh. That\u2019s right.","Not bad.","Okay, you\u2019ve got this."],t.s)
B.a8y=s(["Eh. It happens.","Missed. We\u2019ll live.","Hmm. Almost. Well\u2026 no."],t.s)
B.a8Q=s(["{n} in a row. Showing off a bit.","{n} straight\u2026 okay, respect."],t.s)
B.anN=s(["No mistakes. I\u2019m not saying anything, but that\u2019s strong."],t.s)
B.am8=s(["Done. Cleanly."],t.s)
B.akh=s(["Laborious, but finished. It counts."],t.s)
B.ah_=s(["Listen. Once should do."],t.s)
B.ai0=s(["Your turn. No stress."],t.s)
B.ard=new A.bt([B.bh,B.a8R,B.bi,B.a8y,B.br,B.a8Q,B.bs,B.anN,B.bt,B.am8,B.bu,B.akh,B.bv,B.ah_,B.bw,B.ai0],t.d)
B.amr=s(["Heyyy! That\u2019s it!","There you go! You got it!","Ha ha! Too good!"],t.s)
B.aeE=s(["Ouch! No worries, again!","Happens to everyone, even me!","Almost! The next one is yours!"],t.s)
B.ag1=s(["{n} in a row! Nobody can stop you!","{n}! The whole market is clapping!"],t.s)
B.ahD=s(["Flawless! Today you\u2019re the boss!"],t.s)
B.abi=s(["Lesson done! You\u2019re moving fast!"],t.s)
B.alZ=s(["It was hard, but you held on! That\u2019s courage!"],t.s)
B.anP=s(["Listen closely, it sounds lovely!"],t.s)
B.ano=s(["Your turn! Say it loud!"],t.s)
B.arj=new A.bt([B.bh,B.amr,B.bi,B.aeE,B.br,B.ag1,B.bs,B.ahD,B.bt,B.abi,B.bu,B.alZ,B.bv,B.anP,B.bw,B.ano],t.d)
B.anL=s(["Good, keep going like that.","Very good. I knew you could.","You\u2019re improving, I can see it."],t.s)
B.aii=s(["It\u2019s all right. We\u2019ll go again together.","Gently. Mistakes are part of the way.","Courage, you\u2019re almost there."],t.s)
B.aig=s(["{n} right answers in a row. I\u2019m proud of you.","{n}! See, you can do it."],t.s)
B.abe=s(["Not a single mistake. Beautiful work."],t.s)
B.alH=s(["Lesson finished. A little more every day."],t.s)
B.aip=s(["You held on to the end, and that\u2019s what counts."],t.s)
B.alf=s(["Listen, as many times as you like."],t.s)
B.ao9=s(["Repeat after me, gently."],t.s)
B.arh=new A.bt([B.bh,B.anL,B.bi,B.aii,B.br,B.aig,B.bs,B.abe,B.bt,B.alH,B.bu,B.aip,B.bv,B.alf,B.bw,B.ao9],t.d)
B.ae4=s(["Hey, are you cheating? That\u2019s right!","Nice! I thought you were slower.","Correct. Don\u2019t get a big head."],t.s)
B.adL=s(["Oops! I\u2019ll keep that to myself.","Missed! I\u2019ve seen worse\u2026 me, for instance.","Ha! Almost. Almost."],t.s)
B.acR=s(["{n} in a row? Do you want my job?","{n}! Fine, I\u2019ll stop teasing."],t.s)
B.aea=s(["Flawless? You had the answers in your pocket, admit it."],t.s)
B.anl=s(["Done! See, when you want to."],t.s)
B.ahh=s(["You sweated, but it\u2019s done!"],t.s)
B.afm=s(["Listen well, I won\u2019t say it twice. Okay, I will."],t.s)
B.amy=s(["Your turn! And speak clearly."],t.s)
B.ari=new A.bt([B.bh,B.ae4,B.bi,B.adL,B.br,B.acR,B.bs,B.aea,B.bt,B.anl,B.bu,B.ahh,B.bv,B.afm,B.bw,B.amy],t.d)
B.aiu=s(["Good, my child.","There. You speak like one of us.","Right. Patience pays."],t.s)
B.ac6=s(["It\u2019s nothing. We fall, we get up.","Even the old lion learned to walk.","Today\u2019s mistake is tomorrow\u2019s knowledge."],t.s)
B.al4=s(["{n} in a row. You have a good head, my child.","{n} right answers. The village will be proud."],t.s)
B.ac4=s(["Not one mistake. Go, you\u2019ve earned your meal."],t.s)
B.alQ=s(["The lesson is over. Little by little, the language settles in."],t.s)
B.afe=s(["You struggled, you finished. That is real strength."],t.s)
B.agB=s(["Listen the way you listen to a tale."],t.s)
B.akI=s(["Your turn. Speak without fear."],t.s)
B.arf=new A.bt([B.bh,B.aiu,B.bi,B.ac6,B.br,B.al4,B.bs,B.ac4,B.bt,B.alQ,B.bu,B.afe,B.bv,B.agB,B.bw,B.akI],t.d)
B.amD=s(["Yesss! That\u2019s the one!","Wow, you already know that?","Right! One more!"],t.s)
B.adv=s(["Oh\u2026 that wasn\u2019t it. I get it wrong too.","Missed! Try again?","Oops! We\u2019ll get the next one."],t.s)
B.alt=s(["{n} in a row! That\u2019s amazing!","{n}! I want to do that too!"],t.s)
B.aek=s(["No mistakes! You\u2019ll get a good grade!"],t.s)
B.adN=s(["Finished! Shall we do another?"],t.s)
B.aj5=s(["It was hard, but we finished!"],t.s)
B.amP=s(["Listen, listen! What\u2019s that word?"],t.s)
B.ahk=s(["Your turn to speak!"],t.s)
B.arb=new A.bt([B.bh,B.amD,B.bi,B.adv,B.br,B.alt,B.bs,B.aek,B.bt,B.adN,B.bu,B.aj5,B.bv,B.amP,B.bw,B.ahk],t.d)
B.a8J=s(["Gorgeous! That sounds right!","Bravo! It sounds like a song.","Perfect, perfect, perfect!"],t.s)
B.ah9=s(["Wrong note! Never mind, again.","Oops! Even stars rehearse.","Missed, but with style!"],t.s)
B.aeM=s(["{n} in a row! What a tempo!","{n}! The crowd is on its feet!"],t.s)
B.aoP=s(["Not one wrong note! Standing ovation!"],t.s)
B.aoJ=s(["Lesson finished! Lovely performance."],t.s)
B.a82=s(["A few wrong notes, but you finished the show!"],t.s)
B.am4=s(["Listen: every word has its music."],t.s)
B.aeO=s(["The mic is yours!"],t.s)
B.arp=new A.bt([B.bh,B.a8J,B.bi,B.ah9,B.br,B.aeM,B.bs,B.aoP,B.bt,B.aoJ,B.bu,B.a82,B.bv,B.am4,B.bw,B.aeO],t.d)
B.aep=s(["There! That\u2019s how we say it, I confirm.","Good! Even my passengers don\u2019t know that.","Right answer, boss!"],t.s)
B.anJ=s(["Ouch, wrong turn! Let\u2019s go back.","Traffic jam in your head? It happens.","Missed! I\u2019ll drop you at the same spot."],t.s)
B.adE=s(["{n} in a row! No red lights for you!","Combo of {n}! Fasten your seat belt."],t.s)
B.ad2=s(["Flawless! A perfect ride, not one pothole."],t.s)
B.alG=s(["Last stop! Good ride, boss."],t.s)
B.ans=s(["The road was rough, but we made it!"],t.s)
B.akf=s(["Listen closely, like the radio in the taxi."],t.s)
B.a8b=s(["Your turn! Speak up, the road is noisy."],t.s)
B.ark=new A.bt([B.bh,B.aep,B.bi,B.anJ,B.br,B.adE,B.bs,B.ad2,B.bt,B.alG,B.bu,B.ans,B.bv,B.akf,B.bw,B.a8b],t.d)
B.aib=s(["Oh\u2026 that\u2019s right. Well done.","Yes, that\u2019s it.","I\u2026 I think that\u2019s perfect."],t.s)
B.acB=s(["It\u2019s all right\u2026 it happens to me too.","Almost. Shall we\u2026 try again?","Don\u2019t worry."],t.s)
B.aer=s(["{n} in a row\u2026 that\u2019s impressive.","{n}! Sorry, I got carried away."],t.s)
B.anY=s(["No mistakes\u2026 I\u2019d like to take a picture of that."],t.s)
B.ajb=s(["Lesson finished. Thank you for this moment."],t.s)
B.aoq=s(["You didn\u2019t give up. I admire that."],t.s)
B.ad5=s(["Shall we listen together?"],t.s)
B.aiJ=s(["Your turn\u2026 don\u2019t be afraid."],t.s)
B.arn=new A.bt([B.bh,B.aib,B.bi,B.acB,B.br,B.aer,B.bs,B.anY,B.bt,B.ajb,B.bu,B.aoq,B.bv,B.ad5,B.bw,B.aiJ],t.d)
B.anI=s(["Exact.","Correct. Let us continue.","Good. I expected no less."],t.s)
B.aln=s(["No. Read the correction and remember it.","Error. We shall redo it later.","Incorrect. Mind the details."],t.s)
B.an9=s(["{n} in a row. That is serious work.","{n} right answers. Do not slacken."],t.s)
B.aay=s(["Flawless. Top marks, and I rarely give them."],t.s)
B.ady=s(["Lesson finished. Decent work."],t.s)
B.alE=s(["Finished despite the mistakes. Perseverance is noted."],t.s)
B.a8o=s(["Listen attentively."],t.s)
B.a8m=s(["Repeat after me. Distinctly."],t.s)
